/blockquote>GPS is not essential for satellite operation, you can manually enter your location and also the date/time<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Thu Jul 18, 2024 6:36 am</p><hr />
